196
00:21:33,095 --> 00:21:37,519
So sometimes the Buddha said things which were pleasing to hear,

197
00:21:37,938 --> 00:21:42,301
and they would find it difficult to express their joy.

198
00:21:42,682 --> 00:21:47,708
I suppose they just sat there looking rather serious and glum.

199
00:21:47,728 --> 00:22:03,202
So I hope this evening has pulled a lot of things together for you and that you will of course understand that this sort of depth of understanding is really for

200
00:22:03,672 --> 00:22:32,396
investigation if you want if you're interested in it it's for lifting that confidence in the buddha's teachings but at at base uh the practice is extraordinarily simple you know people uh make the first path and fruit knowing hardly anything about buddhism there's um i met a man he he's died now he was a monk a christian monk a carthusian and uh he had gone to burma

201
